Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 13:10:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Extend intro wordmark to redvim

Three letters found a seat beside red,
The dot stayed put, as Ryan said.
The compact card made room to sit;
The smaller panes politely quit.
